# recursive interpolation not allowed

Salida skirbi: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Programa funshonalidat: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), liña-nobo.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Salida skirbi: a, liña-nobo.


